{"chapter_id":"main-quest-23001","main_id":23001,"main_title":"吞金和蓄财","main_description":"卡里米的富翁哈特姆似乎在为某件事情发愁…","chapter_title":"吞金和蓄财","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":2300101,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2300101,"sequence":13,"variant":0,"line_id":230010114,"next_line_ids":[230010115],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":4004,"speaker_text_hash":1566259984,"speaker":"哈特姆","speaker_raw":"哈特姆","text_hash":532363922,"text":"你没有买过期货吗？唔…那就让我给你解释解释，那是一种和现货交易对应的未来交易，就比如说，你身边的这个小家伙…","raw_text":"你没有买过期货吗？唔…那就让我给你解释解释，那是一种和现货交易对应的未来交易，就比如说，你身边的这个小家伙…","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2300101.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-23001","main_id":23001,"main_title":"吞金和蓄财","main_description":"卡里米的富翁哈特姆似乎在为某件事情发愁…","chapter_title":"吞金和蓄财","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":2300101,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2300101,"sequence":14,"variant":0,"line_id":230010115,"next_line_ids":[230010116],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":1005,"speaker_text_hash":1356475093,"speaker":"派蒙","speaker_raw":"派蒙","text_hash":1847184986,"text":"派蒙是派蒙！才不是什么小家伙！","raw_text":"派蒙是派蒙！才不是什么小家伙！","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2300101.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-23001","main_id":23001,"main_title":"吞金和蓄财","main_description":"卡里米的富翁哈特姆似乎在为某件事情发愁…","chapter_title":"吞金和蓄财","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":2300101,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2300101,"sequence":15,"variant":0,"line_id":230010116,"next_line_ids":[230010117],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":4004,"speaker_text_hash":1566259984,"speaker":"哈特姆","speaker_raw":"哈特姆","text_hash":2944829138,"text":"唔哈哈哈，那么派蒙小家伙，你喜欢什么东西？","raw_text":"唔哈哈哈，那么派蒙小家伙，你喜欢什么东西？","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2300101.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-23001","main_id":23001,"main_title":"吞金和蓄财","main_description":"卡里米的富翁哈特姆似乎在为某件事情发愁…","chapter_title":"吞金和蓄财","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":2300101,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2300101,"sequence":16,"variant":0,"line_id":230010117,"next_line_ids":[230010118],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":1005,"speaker_text_hash":1356475093,"speaker":"派蒙","speaker_raw":"派蒙","text_hash":3677232810,"text":"欸？派蒙喜欢…嗯…史莱姆！","raw_text":"欸？派蒙喜欢…嗯…史莱姆！","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2300101.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-23001","main_id":23001,"main_title":"吞金和蓄财","main_description":"卡里米的富翁哈特姆似乎在为某件事情发愁…","chapter_title":"吞金和蓄财","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":2300101,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2300101,"sequence":17,"variant":0,"line_id":230010118,"next_line_ids":[230010144],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":4004,"speaker_text_hash":1566259984,"speaker":"哈特姆","speaker_raw":"哈特姆","text_hash":2601391898,"text":"哈哈哈，好！那就假设我手里有一种史莱姆凝液，价格是一百摩拉一瓶。","raw_text":"哈哈哈，好！那就假设我手里有一种史莱姆凝液，价格是一百摩拉一瓶。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2300101.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-23001","main_id":23001,"main_title":"吞金和蓄财","main_description":"卡里米的富翁哈特姆似乎在为某件事情发愁…","chapter_title":"吞金和蓄财","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":2300101,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2300101,"sequence":18,"variant":0,"line_id":230010144,"next_line_ids":[230010119],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":4004,"speaker_text_hash":1566259984,"speaker":"哈特姆","speaker_raw":"哈特姆","text_hash":3885907546,"text":"今天你花五万摩拉从我这里买入五百瓶史莱姆凝液，这种是现货交易。","raw_text":"今天你花五万摩拉从我这里买入五百瓶史莱姆凝液，这种是现货交易。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2300101.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-23001","main_id":23001,"main_title":"吞金和蓄财","main_description":"卡里米的富翁哈特姆似乎在为某件事情发愁…","chapter_title":"吞金和蓄财","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":2300101,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2300101,"sequence":19,"variant":0,"line_id":230010119,"next_line_ids":[230010120],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":1005,"speaker_text_hash":1356475093,"speaker":"派蒙","speaker_raw":"派蒙","text_hash":3174186978,"text":"这，这也太多了，派蒙吃不完的！","raw_text":"这，这也太多了，派蒙吃不完的！","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2300101.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-23001","main_id":23001,"main_title":"吞金和蓄财","main_description":"卡里米的富翁哈特姆似乎在为某件事情发愁…","chapter_title":"吞金和蓄财","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":2300101,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2300101,"sequence":20,"variant":0,"line_id":230010120,"next_line_ids":[230010121],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":4004,"speaker_text_hash":1566259984,"speaker":"哈特姆","speaker_raw":"哈特姆","text_hash":3523375730,"text":"这就是一个比方嘛…假设你今天买了五百瓶，但你肯定不能保证，每天都会向我购买这么多史莱姆凝液吧？","raw_text":"这就是一个比方嘛…假设你今天买了五百瓶，但你肯定不能保证，每天都会向我购买这么多史莱姆凝液吧？","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2300101.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-23001","main_id":23001,"main_title":"吞金和蓄财","main_description":"卡里米的富翁哈特姆似乎在为某件事情发愁…","chapter_title":"吞金和蓄财","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":2300101,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2300101,"sequence":21,"variant":0,"line_id":230010121,"next_line_ids":[230010122],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":1005,"speaker_text_hash":1356475093,"speaker":"派蒙","speaker_raw":"派蒙","text_hash":3981127434,"text":"唔…唔，要是吃太饱的话，应该就不会买了吧。","raw_text":"唔…唔，要是吃太饱的话，应该就不会买了吧。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2300101.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-23001","main_id":23001,"main_title":"吞金和蓄财","main_description":"卡里米的富翁哈特姆似乎在为某件事情发愁…","chapter_title":"吞金和蓄财","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":2300101,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2300101,"sequence":22,"variant":0,"line_id":230010122,"next_line_ids":[230010123],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":4004,"speaker_text_hash":1566259984,"speaker":"哈特姆","speaker_raw":"哈特姆","text_hash":1456801714,"text":"没错，而我也不能保证，每时每刻都能向你提供史莱姆凝液。","raw_text":"没错，而我也不能保证，每时每刻都能向你提供史莱姆凝液。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2300101.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-23001","main_id":23001,"main_title":"吞金和蓄财","main_description":"卡里米的富翁哈特姆似乎在为某件事情发愁…","chapter_title":"吞金和蓄财","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":2300101,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2300101,"sequence":23,"variant":0,"line_id":230010123,"next_line_ids":[230010124],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":4004,"speaker_text_hash":1566259984,"speaker":"哈特姆","speaker_raw":"哈特姆","text_hash":1629931298,"text":"所以，这个时候期货就出现了。期货不是一般的当着面一手交钱一手交货，而是一种「交易协定」。","raw_text":"所以，这个时候期货就出现了。期货不是一般的当着面一手交钱一手交货，而是一种「交易协定」。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2300101.json"}
