{"chapter_id":"main-quest-23001","main_id":23001,"main_title":"吞金和蓄财","main_description":"卡里米的富翁哈特姆似乎在为某件事情发愁…","chapter_title":"吞金和蓄财","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":2300101,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2300101,"sequence":25,"variant":0,"line_id":230010125,"next_line_ids":[230010126],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":4004,"speaker_text_hash":1566259984,"speaker":"哈特姆","speaker_raw":"哈特姆","text_hash":1676547050,"text":"在我还能提供史莱姆凝液的时候，就会向期货交易所提交出售史莱姆凝液的「交易协定」。","raw_text":"在我还能提供史莱姆凝液的时候，就会向期货交易所提交出售史莱姆凝液的「交易协定」。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2300101.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-23001","main_id":23001,"main_title":"吞金和蓄财","main_description":"卡里米的富翁哈特姆似乎在为某件事情发愁…","chapter_title":"吞金和蓄财","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":2300101,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2300101,"sequence":26,"variant":0,"line_id":230010126,"next_line_ids":[230010127],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":4004,"speaker_text_hash":1566259984,"speaker":"哈特姆","speaker_raw":"哈特姆","text_hash":3459950522,"text":"而你需要史莱姆凝液的时候，就可以去期货交易所查看一下购买史莱姆凝液的「交易协定」。","raw_text":"而你需要史莱姆凝液的时候，就可以去期货交易所查看一下购买史莱姆凝液的「交易协定」。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2300101.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-23001","main_id":23001,"main_title":"吞金和蓄财","main_description":"卡里米的富翁哈特姆似乎在为某件事情发愁…","chapter_title":"吞金和蓄财","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":2300101,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2300101,"sequence":27,"variant":0,"line_id":230010127,"next_line_ids":[230010128],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":4004,"speaker_text_hash":1566259984,"speaker":"哈特姆","speaker_raw":"哈特姆","text_hash":839182938,"text":"「期货交易」，就是精确而巧妙地购买和卖出这种「交易协定」，从而获得利润。","raw_text":"「期货交易」，就是精确而巧妙地购买和卖出这种「交易协定」，从而获得利润。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2300101.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-23001","main_id":23001,"main_title":"吞金和蓄财","main_description":"卡里米的富翁哈特姆似乎在为某件事情发愁…","chapter_title":"吞金和蓄财","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":2300101,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2300101,"sequence":28,"variant":0,"line_id":230010128,"next_line_ids":[230010129],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":4004,"speaker_text_hash":1566259984,"speaker":"哈特姆","speaker_raw":"哈特姆","text_hash":4181735082,"text":"当然啦，我也就是这么打个比方。如果史莱姆凝液真到了要用期货交易的地步，只怕野外的史莱姆都要被抓光了。","raw_text":"当然啦，我也就是这么打个比方。如果史莱姆凝液真到了要用期货交易的地步，只怕野外的史莱姆都要被抓光了。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2300101.json"}
