{"chapter_id":"main-quest-23001","main_id":23001,"main_title":"吞金和蓄财","main_description":"卡里米的富翁哈特姆似乎在为某件事情发愁…","chapter_title":"吞金和蓄财","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":2300101,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2300101,"sequence":32,"variant":0,"line_id":230010132,"next_line_ids":[230010136],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":4004,"speaker_text_hash":1566259984,"speaker":"哈特姆","speaker_raw":"哈特姆","text_hash":2342825954,"text":"但如果能先吃下带来财运的「吞金料理」，情况就不一样了。唯一的问题是…我今天应该吃哪一种呢？","raw_text":"但如果能先吃下带来财运的「吞金料理」，情况就不一样了。唯一的问题是…我今天应该吃哪一种呢？","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2300101.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-23001","main_id":23001,"main_title":"吞金和蓄财","main_description":"卡里米的富翁哈特姆似乎在为某件事情发愁…","chapter_title":"吞金和蓄财","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":2300101,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2300101,"sequence":33,"variant":0,"line_id":230010136,"next_line_ids":[230010137],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":4004,"speaker_text_hash":1566259984,"speaker":"哈特姆","speaker_raw":"哈特姆","text_hash":3324755458,"text":"啊，等一下，我刚才没有注意，你的头发…居然是黄金的颜色啊！真是耀眼，耀眼！","raw_text":"啊，等一下，我刚才没有注意，你的头发…居然是黄金的颜色啊！真是耀眼，耀眼！","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2300101.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-23001","main_id":23001,"main_title":"吞金和蓄财","main_description":"卡里米的富翁哈特姆似乎在为某件事情发愁…","chapter_title":"吞金和蓄财","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":2300101,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2300101,"sequence":34,"variant":0,"line_id":230010137,"next_line_ids":[230010138],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":4004,"speaker_text_hash":1566259984,"speaker":"哈特姆","speaker_raw":"哈特姆","text_hash":1647666730,"text":"黄金这可是财富的象征，由你选出的料理，肯定能给我带来丰厚的财运！","raw_text":"黄金这可是财富的象征，由你选出的料理，肯定能给我带来丰厚的财运！","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2300101.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-23001","main_id":23001,"main_title":"吞金和蓄财","main_description":"卡里米的富翁哈特姆似乎在为某件事情发愁…","chapter_title":"吞金和蓄财","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":2300101,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2300101,"sequence":35,"variant":0,"line_id":230010138,"next_line_ids":[230010139],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":4004,"speaker_text_hash":1566259984,"speaker":"哈特姆","speaker_raw":"哈特姆","text_hash":2189631090,"text":"就由你来帮我挑选一份「吞金料理」吧？我会准备好报酬的。","raw_text":"就由你来帮我挑选一份「吞金料理」吧？我会准备好报酬的。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2300101.json"}
