{"chapter_id":"main-quest-23001","main_id":23001,"main_title":"吞金和蓄财","main_description":"卡里米的富翁哈特姆似乎在为某件事情发愁…","chapter_title":"吞金和蓄财","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":2300101,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2300101,"sequence":38,"variant":0,"line_id":230010141,"next_line_ids":[230010142],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":4004,"speaker_text_hash":1566259984,"speaker":"哈特姆","speaker_raw":"哈特姆","text_hash":1549067186,"text":"哈哈哈，放心吧。我，卡里米的不凡富翁哈特姆在此宣布——赚了有你一份，亏了全算我的，这下放心了吧？","raw_text":"哈哈哈，放心吧。我，卡里米的不凡富翁哈特姆在此宣布——赚了有你一份，亏了全算我的，这下放心了吧？","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2300101.json"}
