{"chapter_id":"main-quest-23001","main_id":23001,"main_title":"吞金和蓄财","main_description":"卡里米的富翁哈特姆似乎在为某件事情发愁…","chapter_title":"吞金和蓄财","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":2300101,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2300101,"sequence":40,"variant":0,"line_id":230010143,"next_line_ids":[],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":4004,"speaker_text_hash":1566259984,"speaker":"哈特姆","speaker_raw":"哈特姆","text_hash":1872523042,"text":"那就请你快帮我选一选，摩拉肉，黄油鸡和「堆高高」这三道料理，到底哪一道才是「吞金料理」吧。","raw_text":"那就请你快帮我选一选，<color=#00E1FFFF>摩拉肉</color>，<color=#00E1FFFF>黄油鸡</color>和<color=#00E1FFFF>「堆高高」</color>这三道料理，到底哪一道才是「吞金料理」吧。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2300101.json"}
