{"chapter_id":"main-quest-23001","main_id":23001,"main_title":"吞金和蓄财","main_description":"卡里米的富翁哈特姆似乎在为某件事情发愁…","chapter_title":"吞金和蓄财","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":2300101,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2300101,"sequence":42,"variant":0,"line_id":230010134,"next_line_ids":[230010135],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":4004,"speaker_text_hash":1566259984,"speaker":"哈特姆","speaker_raw":"哈特姆","text_hash":1140723602,"text":"把所有好的食材混在一起，最后反而做出了黑暗料理，这种事也是常有的吧？","raw_text":"把所有好的食材混在一起，最后反而做出了黑暗料理，这种事也是常有的吧？","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2300101.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-23001","main_id":23001,"main_title":"吞金和蓄财","main_description":"卡里米的富翁哈特姆似乎在为某件事情发愁…","chapter_title":"吞金和蓄财","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":2300101,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2300101,"sequence":43,"variant":0,"line_id":230010135,"next_line_ids":[230010136],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":4004,"speaker_text_hash":1566259984,"speaker":"哈特姆","speaker_raw":"哈特姆","text_hash":1157768042,"text":"财富运势也一样，全部吃掉只会适得其反，必须选出最有效的一种「吞金料理」。","raw_text":"财富运势也一样，全部吃掉只会适得其反，必须选出最有效的一种「吞金料理」。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2300101.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-23001","main_id":23001,"main_title":"吞金和蓄财","main_description":"卡里米的富翁哈特姆似乎在为某件事情发愁…","chapter_title":"吞金和蓄财","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":1,"subquest_id":2300102,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2300102,"sequence":0,"variant":0,"line_id":230010201,"next_line_ids":[],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":4004,"speaker_text_hash":1566259984,"speaker":"哈特姆","speaker_raw":"哈特姆","text_hash":542735226,"text":"怎么样？摩拉肉，黄油鸡和「堆高高」，让我看看你选了什么。","raw_text":"怎么样？<color=#00E1FFFF>摩拉肉</color>，<color=#00E1FFFF>黄油鸡</color>和<color=#00E1FFFF>「堆高高」</color>，让我看看你选了什么。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2300102.json"}
